    An array containing the specified percentiles along the specified axes.

  See also:
    - :func:`jax.numpy.nanquantile`: compute the nan-aware quantile (0.0-1.0)
    - :func:`jax.numpy.percentile`: compute the percentile without special
      handling of NaNs.

